  "body": "## 📝 更新日志\n## [v3.0.36]\n\n### 功能更新\n\n- 导航添加首页和云收藏页\n- 添加详情风格漫画列表\n- 添加默认章节倒序选项\n- 漫画详情页操作栏添加云收藏按钮\n\n### 优化\n\n- 优化书架多选操作体验\n- 优化性能\n\n---\n\n### 📦 推荐下载\n| 平台 | 下载链接 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Windows** | [windows-installer-v3.0.36.exe](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.36/windows-installer-v3.0.36.exe) |\n| **macOS** | [Breeze-macOS-v3.0.36.dmg](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.36/Breeze-macOS-v3.0.36.dmg) |\n| **Android** | [app-arm64-v8a-release-v3.0.36.apk](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.36/app-arm64-v8a-release-v3.0.36.apk) |\n| **iOS** | [Breeze-iOS-v3.0.36.ipa](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.36/Breeze-iOS-v3.0.36.ipa) |\n| **Linux** | [breeze-v3.0.36.flatpak](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.36/breeze-v3.0.36.flatpak) |\n| **Linux (DEB)** | [breeze_3.0.36_amd64-v3.0.36.deb](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze/releases/download/v3.0.36/breeze_3.0.36_amd64-v3.0.36.deb) |\n\n> 💡 **不知道该下载哪个文件？**\n> 请查看 [详细安装指南](https://github.com/deretame/Breeze#-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85)。\n"
